### Continuous vs Classed comparison

- Initially selected: Classed
- Tested: Continuous
- Observation: Classed mode displayed clearer distinctions
  between temperature ranges.
- Continuous mode displayed more gradual colour transitions.
- Initial preference: Classed for identifying distinct
  temperature zones.


