Feature: Layers and Opacity
Worked in my test
Heatmap Layer
- Turning it off made the temperature map disappear.
- Turning it on restored the temperature map.
Polygon Layer
- Turning it on displayed the circular study-area boundary.
- Turning it off removed the boundary.
Heatmap Opacity
- Decreasing opacity made the heatmap less visually prominent.
- Increasing opacity made the colours darker and more prominent.
Overall impression: Layer visibility and opacity controls behaved intuitively and allowed independent control over map elements.

